            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I think what you are looking for is the [MiniPick.builtin.grep](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-pick.html#minipick.builtin.grep):\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nMiniPick.builtin.grep({ pattern = vim.fn.expand(\"<cword\") })\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I think what you are looking for is the <a href=\"https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-pick.html#minipick.builtin.grep\" rel=\"nofollow\">MiniPick.builtin.grep</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"MiniPick.builtin.grep({ pattern = vim.fn.expand(&quot;&lt;cword&quot;) })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniPick</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">builtin</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">grep</span>({ <span class=\"pl-smi\">pattern</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">expand</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>&lt;cword<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>) })</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "I think what you are looking for is the MiniPick.builtin.grep:\nMiniPick.builtin.grep({ pattern = vim.fn.expand(\"<cword\") })",
